            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salta il ciclo usando la variabile <code>auto_pilot</code> nella condizione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"auto_pilot = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" auto_pilot == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Autopilot on: vroom!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  auto_pilot = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>auto_pilot</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché <code>auto_pilot</code> è <code>False</code>, il ciclo deve essere saltato. Usa la variabile nella condizione in modo che non venga stampato nulla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"auto_pilot = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" auto_pilot == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Autopilot on: vroom!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  auto_pilot = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>auto_pilot</code>, seguito da <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
